|content8=
* February 13th - '''The MongolZ''' loan [[Senzu]] to [[Passion UA]]. <ref name="senzu loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2022370565068304406|date=2026-02-13|title=On loan to Passion UA|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
