* September 27th - [[tikuak]] is acquired by [[Chinggis Warriors]]. <ref name="-tikuak">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2104149067953733717|title=tikuak joins the Chinggis Warriors as of today|date=2026-09-27|author='''The MongolZ'''}}</ref>
